[{"title":"雪中见庭菊一株冒寒独秀负隐者之高标有烈士之素概聊为赋之云尔","author":"区大相","text":"庭菊有佳色，逾秋迥自芳。\n为言兼傲雪，何止独淩霜。\n密叶全封翠，繁英稍露黄。\n停杯问群卉，寒意正苍茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22194,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄南宁","author":"区大相","text":"西郡推良牧，中朝宠外臣。\n来瞻枫陛日，还睹桂江春。\n贡篚勤王事，回车慰远人。\n欲知徵诏近，为视玺书新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22195,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东郊看迎春","author":"区大相","text":"今旦风光动，层城气象新。\n隔尘移綵仗，披雪度朱轮。\n枝变园中鸟，帘窥胜里人。\n仍闻宽大诏，万国共回春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22196,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日对酒","author":"区大相","text":"春朝试春酌，陡觉物情春。\n菜畔留觞客，梅边起咏人。\n风光林里转，云影岫头新。\n共恣芳时赏，相看未老身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22197,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上元夜效小庾体","author":"区大相","text":"长安行乐人，上节赏游新。\n楼台宵向曙，弦管夜惊春。\n宝勒灯前度，金妆月下亲。\n别有河桥上，争看洛川神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22198,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕与诸客宴集同用灯字","author":"区大相","text":"十千酬令节，三五会良朋。\n暂假金吾夜，来看绮陌灯。\n清歌人似玉，上客酒如渑。\n何处多游骑，前门火树层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22199,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕与管内史诸公宴集","author":"区大相","text":"宝焰吐芳馨，银缸泻绿醽。\n灯轮辉四座，文酒会中庭。\n花借薇郎紫，藜分太乙青。\n淹留歌舞地，何似德为星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22200,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十七夜庄太史兄宅灯宴","author":"区大相","text":"图史开三管，烟花共一庭。\n灯光射遥汉，帘影散春星。\n节为追欢续，杯缘度曲停。\n正逢文共酒，双眼更宜青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22201,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送崔司马之许州 其一","author":"区大相","text":"送子佐繁昌，驱车颍水阳。\n途逢洗耳客，郡接聚星乡。\n贤里何人住，春流几处芳。\n因君慕高躅，不独海沂康。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22202,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送崔司马之许州 其二","author":"区大相","text":"东风恰摇荡，行子动征骖。\n春事方无赖，离心更不堪。\n草苗一寸绿，山色几重蓝。\n彼地闻贤聚，何时此合簪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22203,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲春","author":"区大相","text":"碧草日夜长，韶光催向分。\n此时东阁客，望见西峰云。\n云边有鸾鹤，欲往难为群。\n长谣采芳曲，惆怅碧林曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22204,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月十五日陪家兄傅逊之高正甫汪公干出郊得闻字","author":"区大相","text":"不觉物华换，郊原春已分。\n东林全吐叶，西岭半埋云。\n草色前溪绿，钟声远寺闻。\n赖多心赏伴，谈笑恋馀曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22205,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈仁甫逸人游蓟门","author":"区大相","text":"春鸿飞碣石，皂帽指辽东。\n可道林中士，依然塞上翁。\n诸侯尊客礼，幕府慕儒风。\n当忆衡门下，劳歌青桂丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22206,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连朝闻太液池凫雁之声","author":"区大相","text":"楼开天苑右，门对液池源。\n常日烟波思，经春凫雁喧。\n群呼知下集，连叫想高鶱。\n忆在江湖上，千声过水村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22207,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食","author":"区大相","text":"花柳发韶年，佳游竞锦鞯。\n异方寒作食，孤馆醉宜眠。\n春思离边冷，乡愁暗里燃。\n惟应河畔草，能解思绵绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22208,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明","author":"区大相","text":"钻燧青烟起，看花旧国迷。\n绿杨萦绪发，黄鸟傍愁啼。\n歌去终逃禄，吟来异执圭。\n故园松槚泪，遥寄岭云西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22209,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食再作","author":"区大相","text":"旅馆仍寒节，家家冷食来。\n河桥沙柳合，山院野桃开。\n马埒游方出，鸡场乐未回。\n何须重禁火，已作不燃灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22210,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归雁","author":"区大相","text":"归雁南中发，闻从桂水滨。\n年还思故土，书至慰离人。\n芳杜江南月，长榆塞北春。\n往来皆应候，嗟尔客游身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22211,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后群雁","author":"区大相","text":"同侣南飞尽，如何独后群。\n已迟关外信，犹阻陇头云。\n短翮追难及，连呼急讵闻。\n层霄徒见慕，谁惜羽毛分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22212,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又咏","author":"区大相","text":"秋去度南天，春来向北燕。\n能鸣常落后，弱羽敢求先。\n雾重群相失，风多影不前。\n犹堪系书札，飞向上林边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22213,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又咏种桃和诸客 其一","author":"区大相","text":"曾闻留汉核，复见避秦源。\n霞影移仙洞，风光近帝园。\n露凝香霭度，日丽锦文翻。\n莫道成蹊易，由来在不言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22214,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又咏种桃和诸客 其二","author":"区大相","text":"不道移根远，芳菲傍日华。\n万年枝畔蕊，三月浪中花。\n近酒时分露，临窗乍落霞。\n谁知仙禁侧，别有武陵家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22215,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送傅博士舒城 其一","author":"区大相","text":"之子重南金，横经席更临。\n儒林他日传，循吏古人心。\n江路南行永，山云北望深。\n瑶琴多苦调，何处觅知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22216,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送傅博士舒城 其二","author":"区大相","text":"平生怀耿介，磊落向时贤。\n言笑方同此，行藏付适然。\n之官回雁后，别友听莺前。\n默默看人事，惟应独守玄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22217,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄谭先辈","author":"区大相","text":"耆旧今虽在，烟霞一杖藜。\n弃官常市隐，避世或岩栖。\n里为高贤重，门应太守题。\n崧台南斗外，岁晚问丹梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22218,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王银台行父以中秋生日同胡孟韬高正父汪公干过余饮","author":"区大相","text":"独有中秋月，偏临上寿杯。\n光华分玉案，清切傍银台。\n灵药风前捣，仙槎海上来。\n年年今夕宴，华发共徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22219,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉酬武选沈郎咏予庭菊 其一","author":"区大相","text":"何意微根里，传君秀句中。\n孤芳徒自保，晚节与谁同。\n留客无三径，编篱有一丛。\n差存高士意，空愧野人风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22220,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉酬武选沈郎咏予庭菊 其二","author":"区大相","text":"寂寂一丛菊，萧萧傍禁林。\n幽香出径浅，寒色映杯深。\n院落迟仍发，烟霜晚更禁。\n惟应一高士，见赏岁寒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22221,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚过王永叔给谏得香字","author":"区大相","text":"西掖重门掩，幽期赴省郎。\n清言惟散帙，宴坐但闻香。\n衣润微沾露，庭寒渐履霜。\n他乡物华暮，小酌兴何长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22222,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒日","author":"区大相","text":"霜林无一叶，寒日复多风。\n硕果犹存否，危巢本易空。\n诛求三户尽，杼轴万方同。\n白石南山曲，悲歌夜未终。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22223,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谭司理之越西","author":"区大相","text":"得近霜台使，无如郡法曹。\n途趋蛮府远，山绕瘴烟高。\n夷落无多事，乡音或间操。\n知君心好静，佐理莫辞劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22224,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁井卿之广平","author":"区大相","text":"自请儒官出，应嫌州县劳。\n路经沱水远，云近太行高。\n临别逢征雁，惊秋问敝袍。\n怀君欲有赠，强食当持醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22225,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送慧上人还江南兼寄陆伯生文学","author":"区大相","text":"孤云与独鹤，去住本无依。\n觉路何人往，空门羡尔归。\n晨钟吴苑树，晚饭越山薇。\n相见陆居士，茶经对息机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22226,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月八日王行甫招饮高梁河 其一","author":"区大相","text":"车马隘城闉，河桥争渡人。\n东方行乐意，西土降生辰。\n帷幕平连寺，歌钟近隔尘。\n问君喧与寂，相去几由旬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22227,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月八日王行甫招饮高梁河 其二","author":"区大相","text":"共说调心易，谁能对境忘。\n烟尘迷觉路，冠尽聚津梁。\n未听三车演，先过百戏坊。\n如何空寂意，翻助冶游场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22228,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上谷客舍喜雨和四家兄","author":"区大相","text":"阻饥三岁后，不雨十旬馀。\n飒遝初鸣块，滂沱遂溢渠。\n乍凉风却扇，久旱泽随车。\n作润功非细，为霖望匪虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22229,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途次遇雨","author":"区大相","text":"已惬农人望，翻增旅客吟。\n云来三辅密，雨过二陵深。\n假盖人何吝，冲泥马屡寻。\n近京沾足否，明主在桑林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22230,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重憩吕公祠 其一","author":"区大相","text":"仙翁有遗迹，寂寂閟玄关。\n古路尘埃满，荒庭鸟雀闲。\n荣枯残梦里，风月朗吟间。\n日暮邯郸道，征车殊未还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22231,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重憩吕公祠 其二","author":"区大相","text":"重憩荒祠下，独吟千古春。\n空馀车马地，犹带绮罗尘。\n南陌桑阴晚，丛台草色新。\n烦将觉后意，说向梦中人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22232,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"既渡滹沱劳徒御作","author":"区大相","text":"炎月征途苦，兼之岁复侵。\n汉皇思麦饭，魏帝指梅林。\n饥渴那能免，风沙转不禁。\n息徒劳行役，因作旅人吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22233,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后自恒山趋钜鹿","author":"区大相","text":"官路忽成河，回车就浅莎。\n湿云沉井陉，新水下滹沱。\n野润槐烟细，风喧柳浪多。\n愁霖非所叹，劳者易为歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22234,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庆都尧母祠 其一","author":"区大相","text":"诞圣名犹茂，开唐业故隆。\n云沾瑶席冷，日晃翠帷空。\n松柏连高陇，丹青落旧宫。\n惟馀土阶在，独见古皇风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22235,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庆都尧母祠 其二","author":"区大相","text":"万古慈宫肃，中天帝道昌。\n麦秋时荐食，蚕月想垂裳。\n雨洗春墙碧，烟含晚砌芳。\n如何金屋里，翻使旧名扬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22236,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚过望陵台","author":"区大相","text":"铜台不可望，望去使人愁。\n魏国无遗业，漳河有浊流。\n空城临废井，古木带荒丘。\n何事词人恨，犹怀邺下游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22237,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒殷太师墓 其一","author":"区大相","text":"剖心非所惮，殒志始含凄。\n墓是周王表，碑犹孔圣题。\n原田无牧唱，宰木有乌啼。\n白日兼愁暮，高天逐恨低。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22238,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒殷太师墓 其二","author":"区大相","text":"殷墟不可问，朝代几消沉。\n直谏流终古，孤坟表至今。\n惊风飘落日，右道属前林。\n试问东周士，何人为剖心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22239,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"啸台作","author":"区大相","text":"昔贤嘉遁处，林石有馀清。\n当日阮嵇辈，来听鸾凤鸣。\n高台苍藓合，古木暮云平。\n可叹驱驰子，空悬遗世情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22240,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寻安乐窝故址","author":"区大相","text":"范阳移寓后，读易此林阿。\n画自先天启，经传后进多。\n玄言探河洛，幽意閟藤萝。\n击壤闻遗咏，高山想旧窝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22241,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再游嵩少","author":"区大相","text":"忆昨游仙梦，嵩阳有故山。\n殷勤东溪月，待我青林间。\n新松生旧石，后水赴前湾。\n何如辽海鹤，千岁一来还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22242,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"少林晚坐","author":"区大相","text":"山扉横石景，夕室吐晴烟。\n门对吹笙岭，窗临洗耳泉。\n岩阴回竹院，香梵起花天。\n坐待浮丘鹤，归来松上眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22243,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓过南溪偕道公","author":"区大相","text":"朝来北林下，偶与山僧期。\n复值松风至，翛然箕颍思。\n笑谈欣有得，历涉遂忘疲。\n报导前宵雨，南岩长紫芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题道公新建溪南精舍 其一","author":"区大相","text":"一灯传教后，此地又开山。\n二室三花里，千峰万木间。\n香台携鹤上，竹院待云还。\n既了安心义，何须长闭关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题道公新建溪南精舍 其二","author":"区大相","text":"居士住人天，精庐水石边。\n傍林开宝界，持钵酌香泉。\n花发传灯后，鸟归鸣磬前。\n上方留客处，松月共安禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访具次阻雨马户部村庄作","author":"区大相","text":"重来七圣路，回首襄城阴。\n雨至烟村失，云归山径沉。\n飞流奔绝涧，复栈起危岑。\n牧马何方问，迷途岂自今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次襄城","author":"区大相","text":"苍茫襄野外，迢递首山阿。\n道遇一童问，途经七圣过。\n峰阴迷御跸，林响递仙歌。\n望望白云尽，其如天路何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过叶偶访邑人宋明府园亭留酌","author":"区大相","text":"姓名犹未达，径造主人园。\n祇道双凫县，谁知五柳门。\n欢言成握手，晴景属开樽。\n见说辞官早，烟萝秋正繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入南阳界","author":"区大相","text":"北洛风犹在，南阳气已新。\n徒闻帝王里，尚想侠游尘。\n地湿遥连楚，山高半入秦。\n明朝南郡去，先访卧龙人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登卧龙冈寻草庐故址 其一","author":"区大相","text":"连冈带长薄，三顾有遗墟。\n地势昔龙卧，山光旧草庐。\n阵图云鸟散，耕陇野人锄。\n感激君臣际，深思得水鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登卧龙冈寻草庐故址 其二","author":"区大相","text":"王佐才何忝，雄图嗟至今。\n三分扶汉业，二表出师心。\n冈在寻遗陇，庐荒想旧林。\n眺馀空抱膝，梁甫为谁吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邓太守招饮卧龙冈","author":"区大相","text":"胜地敞华筵，崇冈想昔贤。\n卧龙犹故国，下凤是今年。\n三顾名空在，专城业旧传。\n忽闻歌召杜，五马莫留连。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚投遇真宫行二十里松柏林下","author":"区大相","text":"新甫千年柏，西湖九里松。\n共阴白石路，来接紫霞峰。\n风韵笙簧杂，岚光衣袖重。\n金膏遥可饵，时为制颓容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游玉虚宫","author":"区大相","text":"披云步玉虚，营卫象宸居。\n万树罗深殿，千峰入广除。\n丹宫金凤管，紫府玉函书。\n壮丽观何已，高真意有馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至五龙宫","author":"区大相","text":"山暝昼闻猿，仙宫向水源。\n阴天龙护法，古洞鹤能言。\n树密林先暗，泉鸣溪乱喧。\n不辞登陟险，陡觉近天门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿南岩","author":"区大相","text":"南岩果奇绝，石槛宛长霓。\n俯瞰千寻壑，回登万仞梯。\n云边孤磬寂，天外数峰低。\n信宿仙都近，平明试一跻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上南岩与杨宪长相遇","author":"区大相","text":"来探奇绝境，幸接烟霞颜。\n是日方披雾，逢君遂下山。\n将期采药去，便挟飞仙还。\n抗手揖云际，因声谢世间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中经仙女祠","author":"区大相","text":"寂寂幽宫闭，仙娥行雨归。\n晚篁风际碧，秋草洞中菲。\n松老沾逾翠，云轻湿不飞。\n珊珊仙步接，徒使世情违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冒雨趋紫霄宫","author":"区大相","text":"焚香游桂阈，解佩阅松寮。\n不觉霓裳湿，徒闻羽盖飘。\n烟霞年复岁，云雨暮将朝。\n未解烧丹灶，先来陟紫霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再至遇真宫","author":"区大相","text":"真人不可遇，重入遇真宫。\n尘界何年隔，天门此路通。\n炉前丹火冷，斋后酒杯空。\n催取胡麻饭，衰颜即返童。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入太和山游道院作 其一","author":"区大相","text":"云峰自送迎，涧道乱纵横。\n林木有千岁，山禽时一鸣。\n雨来岩岫失，风过石泉清。\n讵取丹砂志，将怡云壑情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]